# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# THIS REPO IS PUBLIC (github.com/Sdu15/exposurelab) AND ITS ROOT IS THE
# CLOUDFLARE PAGES DEPLOY ROOT FOR hkexposurelab.com.
#
# Therefore: deny everything, then allow ONLY the files the website serves.
# Anything not listed below stays private and is never deployed.
#
# This is deny-by-default so that a future `git add .` cannot accidentally
# publish client work, contact lists, or private business strategy.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
/*
!.gitignore
!.cf-rebuild
!README.md

# ── The website itself (what hkexposurelab.com serves) ──
!index.html
!robots.txt
!sitemap.xml
!llms.txt
!*.svg

# ── Explicit blocks, even if a rule above ever loosens ──
# Client work — confidential
marlow-bray/
deliverables/
work/

# Contact data — real people's names, emails and phone numbers
hk-leadgen/
data/

# Private business strategy
client-acquisition-plan.md
business-analysis.md
hkstp-rehearsal-plan.md
prep-checklist.md
WORKSPACE.md

# Third-party reference material (copyrighted, 132 MB)
references/

# Working directories
ss/
scripts/
output/
brand/
reels/
reel/
motion-studio/
my-video/
money-reel/
